<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>BARS Institute — See what could happen before you decide.</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="BARS compares two business decisions across thousands of simulated scenarios, then shows you what the result depends on and where the comparison flips."
  >

  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://bars.institute/">

  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="BARS Institute — See what could happen before you decide.">
  <meta
    property="og:description"
    content="Most models tell you which option wins. BARS tells you which assumption that result is resting on, and what it would take to change it."
  >
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://bars.institute/">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="BARS Institute">

  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="BARS Institute — See what could happen before you decide.">
  <meta
    name="twitter:description"
    content="Which assumption is your decision resting on, and where does it flip?"
  >

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@500;600;700&family=Public+Sans:opsz,wght@10..24,300;10..24,400;10..24,500;10..24,600&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  >

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "BARS Institute",
    "url": "https://bars.institute",
    "description": "Decision-support software that compares two business options under uncertainty and identifies the assumption the comparison depends on."
  }
  </script>

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What does BARS actually tell me?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Which of two options produces the better outcome across thousands of simulated scenarios, how much better, how much room for error there is, and which single assumption the result is resting on and the exact value at which the comparison flips."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How is this different from Excel or @RISK?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Excel and specialist risk tools like @RISK give you powerful building blocks for modelling uncertainty. BARS packages those capabilities around a specific decision workflow: compare two options, identify the assumption carrying the result, and find the boundary at which the comparison changes."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need a statistics background?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. You give a likely value and a low and a high — the way you would describe it to a colleague. The engine handles the distribution. Every technical choice it makes on your behalf is stated in the report rather than applied silently."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do I know the numbers are right?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Every run carries a random seed and an engine version, so the same model reproduces the same figures exactly. Every report includes a technical appendix with the equations, the provenance of every assumption, and every default the engine applied."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What if an assumption is a guess?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Say so, and it is recorded as an estimate rather than treated as fact. It appears in the provenance trail, in the flagged-assumptions list, and usually as the assumption the whole decision turns on."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What decisions can it model?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Five two-option decisions: hire now or wait, in-house or outside provider, invest or don't, raise prices or hold, and proceed or hold on a plan."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <style>
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    :root {
      --white: #ffffff;
      --surface: #f5f7fc;

      --ink: #17243d;
      --ink-mid: #4c5670;
      --ink-muted: #8891a6;

      --border: #e4e8f0;
      --border-soft: #edf0f6;

      --navy: #1d2f4e;
      --navy-deep: #17243d;
      --blue-deep: #2a5187;
      --blue: #3567a8;
      --periwinkle: #7d8ec4;
      --pink: #e8b7c5;
      --pink-soft: #f2d5dd;

      --banner-blue: #438fb9;
      --banner-blue-light: #58a9c9;
      --banner-pink: #ee8e9d;
      --banner-mauve: #e3abc1;

      --gold: #b8862e;
      --gold-soft: #f6efdc;

      --shadow:
        0 1px 2px rgba(23, 36, 61, 0.04),
        0 14px 34px -18px rgba(23, 36, 61, 0.16);
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: "Public Sans", sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 {
      font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
    }

    a:focus-visible,
    button:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--blue);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .grad-text {
      background: linear-gradient(
        100deg,
        var(--navy) 4%,
        var(--blue) 55%,
        var(--pink) 100%
      );

      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    /* HEADER */

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 42% 180% at 25% 0%,
          rgba(238, 142, 157, 0.36),
          transparent 70%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 50% 180% at 72% 0%,
          rgba(125, 142, 196, 0.4),
          transparent 70%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          105deg,
          #58a9c9 0%,
          #438fb9 48%,
          #357faa 100%
        );

      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      padding: 0 48px;
      height: 64px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;

      color: var(--white);
      font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo svg {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .header-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .header-nav a:not(.header-cta) {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .header-nav a:not(.header-cta):hover {
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .header-cta {
      display: inline-block;

      background: rgba(23, 36, 61, 0.84);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      border-radius: 7px;
      color: var(--white) !important;

      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 9px 18px;
      text-decoration: none;

      transition:
        background 0.2s,
        transform 0.2s;
    }

    .header-cta:hover {
      background: rgba(23, 36, 61, 0.98);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 5px;

      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border: none;
      background: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .menu-toggle span {
      display: block;
      width: 22px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--white);
      transition:
        transform 0.2s,
        opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .menu-toggle.open span:nth-child(1) {
      transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg);
    }

    .menu-toggle.open span:nth-child(2) {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .menu-toggle.open span:nth-child(3) {
      transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg);
    }

    .mobile-nav {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;

      position: sticky;
      top: 64px;
      z-index: 99;

      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;

      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);

      transition: max-height 0.25s ease;
    }

    .mobile-nav.open {
      max-height: 400px;
    }

    .mobile-nav a {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .mobile-nav a.header-cta {
      margin: 12px 24px;
      border-bottom: none;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* HERO */

    .hero-bg {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--banner-blue-light) 0%,
          var(--banner-blue) 48%,
          #347eaa 100%
        );
    }

    .hero-bg::before {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      inset: -15% -10%;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 38% 48% at 8% 52%,
          rgba(238, 142, 157, 0.85),
          transparent 62%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 42% 52% at 27% 8%,
          rgba(241, 178, 190, 0.72),
          transparent 65%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 48% 55% at 52% 0%,
          rgba(227, 171, 193, 0.66),
          transparent 65%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 58% 65% at 82% 4%,
          rgba(82, 155, 195, 0.75),
          transparent 68%
        );

      filter: blur(46px);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;

      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.02fr 0.98fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 60px;

      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 92px 48px 72px;
    }

    .hero-main {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      margin-bottom: 18px;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;

      color: var(--white);
      font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 54px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .hero .grad-text {
      background: linear-gradient(
        100deg,
        #ffffff 0%,
        #f2d5dd 55%,
        #e8b7c5 100%
      );

      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      font-size: 16.5px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;

      background: var(--white);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--navy-deep);

      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: "Public Sans", sans-serif;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      text-decoration: none;

      transition: transform 0.15s;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      display: inline-block;

      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--white);

      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      text-decoration: none;

      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .hero-note {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* HERO CARD */

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .sim-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 26px;
    }

    .sim-card-label {
      margin-bottom: 4px;

      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sim-verdict {
      margin-bottom: 3px;

      font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .verdict-grad {
      background: linear-gradient(
        100deg,
        var(--navy) 0%,
        var(--blue) 58%,
        var(--pink) 118%
      );

      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .sim-verdict-sub {
      margin-bottom: 20px;

      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .sim-flip {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 16px 18px;

      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: 9px;
    }

    .sim-flip-label {
      margin-bottom: 7px;

      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sim-flip-text {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.62;
    }

    .sim-flip-text strong {
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .sim-scale {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0;
      margin: 14px 0 6px;
    }

    .sim-scale-track {
      position: relative;

      flex: 1;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          var(--blue) 0%,
          var(--blue) 56%,
          var(--pink) 56%,
          var(--pink) 100%
        );
    }

    .sim-scale-mark {
      position: absolute;
      top: -5px;

      width: 2px;
      height: 16px;
      border-radius: 1px;
      background: var(--navy-deep);
    }

    .sim-scale-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;

      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .sim-foot {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-top: 14px;

      border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* GENERAL SECTIONS */

    section.block {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 92px 48px;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      margin-bottom: 12px;

      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;

      font-size: clamp(27px, 3.1vw, 35px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .section-intro {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 52px;

      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 15.5px;
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    /* WORKED EXAMPLE */

    .case {
      padding: 92px 48px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .case-inner {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .case-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 56px;
      margin-top: 44px;
    }

    .case-panel {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .case-panel h3 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .metric-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;

      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      padding: 11px 0;

      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .metric-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .metric-label {
      color: var(--ink-mid);
    }

    .metric-value {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .case-note {
      margin-top: 18px;

      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.68;
    }

    .case-quote {
      margin-bottom: 18px;

      font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 25px);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      line-height: 1.38;
    }

    .case-quote .hl {
      background: linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        transparent 62%,
        var(--pink-soft) 62%
      );
    }

    /* HOW IT WORKS */

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .step-card {
      position: relative;

      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 26px 24px;

      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.25s ease,
        border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .step-card::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;

      border-radius: inherit;
      padding: 1.5px;

      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        var(--navy),
        var(--blue) 50%,
        var(--pink)
      );

      -webkit-mask:
        linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,
        linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);

      -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
      mask-composite: exclude;

      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
    }

    .step-card:hover {
      border-color: transparent;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 34px -20px rgba(53, 103, 168, 0.42);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .step-card:hover::after {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .step-num {
      margin-bottom: 12px;

      color: var(--blue);
      font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .step-title {
      margin-bottom: 8px;

      font-size: 15.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .step-desc {
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    /* PRINCIPLE */

    .principle {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 92px 48px;
    }

    .principle-inner {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 60px;
    }

    .chain-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px 0;
    }

    .chain-row:not(:last-child) {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .chain-dot {
      flex-shrink: 0;

      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;

      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--pink));
    }

    .chain-title {
      margin-bottom: 4px;

      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .chain-desc {
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* DECISION TYPES */

    .use-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .use-card {
      position: relative;

      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 24px;

      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.25s ease,
        border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .use-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(53, 103, 168, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 34px -20px rgba(53, 103, 168, 0.4);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .use-card::before {
      content: "";

      display: block;
      width: 34px;
      height: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border-radius: 2px;

      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--navy), var(--pink));
    }

    .use-title {
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      font-size: 15.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .use-desc {
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .use-tags {
      margin-top: 14px;

      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    /* WHO IT IS FOR */

    .who-strip {
      padding: 72px 48px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .who-inner {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .who-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .who-chip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;

      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 11px 19px;

      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .who-chip .dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--pink));
    }

    /* FAQ */

    .faq-list {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .faq-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .faq-item:first-child {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .faq-q {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;

      width: 100%;
      padding: 22px 4px;

      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: var(--ink);

      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: "Public Sans", sans-serif;
      font-size: 15.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .faq-q .icon {
      position: relative;
      flex-shrink: 0;

      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
    }

    .faq-q .icon::before,
    .faq-q .icon::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: var(--navy);

      transition:
        transform 0.2s,
        opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .faq-q .icon::before {
      top: 9px;
      left: 2px;
      width: 16px;
      height: 2px;
    }

    .faq-q .icon::after {
      top: 2px;
      left: 9px;
      width: 2px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .faq-item.open .faq-q .icon::after {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .faq-a {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 0.25s ease;
    }

    .faq-a p {
      max-width: 660px;
      padding: 0 4px 22px;

      color: var(--ink-mid);
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    /* CTA */

    .cta-section {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;

      padding: 92px 48px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse 52% 75% at 75% 0%,
          rgba(238, 142, 157, 0.35),
          transparent 70%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #347eaa 0%,
          #438fb9 45%,
          #58a9c9 80%,
          #d99bad 150%
        );

      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-section::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      bottom: -180px;
      left: 50%;

      width: 760px;
      height: 440px;
      border-radius: 50%;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle,
          rgba(232, 183, 197, 0.34),
          rgba(232, 183, 197, 0) 70%
        );

      pointer-events: none;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    .cta-section h2 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;

      margin-bottom: 16px;

      color: var(--white);
      font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
      line-height: 1.14;
    }

    .cta-sub {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;

      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .cta-actions {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;

      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .cta-small {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;

      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    footer {
      padding: 32px 48px;
      background: var(--navy-deep);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;

      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .footer-l {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .footer-r {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
      font-size: 12.5px;
    }

    /* ANIMATION */

    .hero-main > *,
    .hero-visual .sim-card {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(14px);
      animation: heroIn 0.6s ease forwards;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      animation-delay: 0.05s;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      animation-delay: 0.13s;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    .hero-note {
      animation-delay: 0.26s;
    }

    .hero-visual .sim-card {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    @keyframes heroIn {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .hero-main > *,
      .hero-visual .sim-card {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
        animation: none;
      }
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .steps {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .use-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .principle-inner,
      .case-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 36px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      header {
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      .header-nav a:not(.header-cta),
      .header-nav .header-cta {
        display: none;
      }

      .menu-toggle {
        display: flex;
      }

      .mobile-nav {
        display: flex;
      }

      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 36px;
        padding: 52px 24px 44px;
      }

      .hero-bg::before {
        inset: -20% -30%;
        filter: blur(34px);
      }

      section.block,
      .principle {
        padding: 56px 24px;
      }

      .case,
      .who-strip,
      .cta-section {
        padding: 56px 24px;
      }

      .steps,
      .use-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

