              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="chain-row">
            <span class="chain-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>

            <div>
              <div class="chain-title">
                A technical appendix with every report
              </div>

              <div class="chain-desc">
                The equations, the provenance of every assumption, and every
                adjustment the engine made. It gives another reviewer
                everything needed to inspect exactly how the result was
                produced.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="chain-row">
            <span class="chain-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>

            <div>
              <div class="chain-title">
                Estimates are labelled as estimates
              </div>

              <div class="chain-desc">
                Anything you could not evidence is flagged in the report and
                can turn out to be the assumption the decision rests on.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="block" id="decisions">
